ggered word reveal on scroll with GSAP ScrollTrigger."},{id:"scrolltrigger-storytelling",label:"GSAP ScrollTrigger",preview:"Sticky story",description:"Create a GSAP ScrollTrigger experience with sticky product storytelling, progressive UI reveals, scroll-synced animations, smooth interpolation, cinematic aesthetic, and immersive transitions between sections."},{id:"rich-micro-interactions",label:"Rich Interactions",preview:"Every control",description:"Add rich micro-interactions on every interactive element, including buttons, cards, links, controls, inputs, and media hovers."},{id:"in-view-cascade",label:"In-view Cascade",preview:"Fade / Slide / Blur",description:"Animate when in view using observers: fade in, slide in, blur in, and reveal element by element with staggered timing."},{id:"smooth-scroll",label:"Smooth Scroll",preview:"Lenis / Locomotive",description:"Add smooth scroll with Lenis or locomotive-scroll, using refined scroll smoothing, momentum, and careful fallback behavior so the page feels premium without breaking native navigation."},{id:"magnetic-buttons",label:"Magnetic Buttons",preview:"Awwwards hover",description:"Add Awwwards-style button animations with magnetic hover, fluid movement, smooth interpolation, and cinematic polish."}],roe=[{id:"awwwards-polish",label:"Awwwards Polish",preview:"Motion + visuals",description:"Apply Awwwards-level motion and visual polish with sophisticated pacing, refined composition, premium details, and memorable section transitions."},{id:"detailed-dynamic-buttons",label:"Detailed Dynamic Buttons",preview:"Hover + states",description:"Add detailed dynamic buttons with layered hover states, pressed states, loading states, focus-visible states, icon motion, text transitions, tactile shadows, and polished micro-interactions."},{id:"svg-logo-branding",label:"SVG Logo Branding",preview:"Brand marks",description:"Use SVG logo branding for the site logo and brand marks. Create crisp inline SVG symbols, wordmarks, or monograms with responsive sizing, monochrome and dark-mode variants, and consistent brand lockups."},{id:"agency-studio",label:"Agency Studio",preview:"Upscale headings",description:"Make it upscale, agency studio style with big headings, confident typography, premium spacing, polished imagery, and editorial composition."},{id:"fully-responsive",label:"Fully Responsive",preview:"All breakpoints",description:"Make the page fully responsive across mobile, tablet, laptop, and desktop with no overlapping text, clipped controls, or broken layout states."},{id:"numbered-details",label:"01 02 03 Details",preview:"Number marks",description:"Add 01 02 03 number details as refined editorial markers for steps, features, proof points, or section metadata."},{id:"rich-images-avatars",label:"Rich Images + Avatars",preview:"Photos + people",description:"Add rich images and photo avatars throughout the page. Use premium product, lifestyle, editorial, testimonial, team, or customer imagery where it improves credibility and visual depth."},{id:"beautiful-shadows",label:"Beautiful Shadows",preview:"sm / md / lg",description:"Beautiful Shadows Skill: Use these exact Tailwind shadow utilities when polished, layered elevation is needed. Shadow: Beautiful sm `shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]`. Shadow: Beautiful md `shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]`. Shadow: Beautiful lg `shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]`. Use Beautiful sm for compact cards, form controls, pills, and quieter surfaces. Use Beautiful md for cards, panels, popovers, and the default elevated surface style. Use Beautiful lg for hero media, feature callouts, modal-like containers, and the strongest lift. Avoid mixing these with default Tailwind shadow scales on the same component. Avoid tinting these shadows with strong colors; keep them neutral and refined."},{id:"framed-grid-layout",label:"Framed Grid Layout",preview:"Guide lines",description:"Use a minimal framed grid layout with thin visible boundary lines outlining each section. Add L-shaped corner brackets on container edges to emphasize the frame. Use subtle diagonal background lines at 1px and very low opacity for light texture. Keep everything consistent across sections. Each section sits inside a precise framed box with thin guide borders, strict vertical and horizontal alignment, clear separation between sections, and consistent spacing between frames. Keep it clean, neutral, grid-based, and highly structured."}],noe=[{id:"solar-linear",label:"Solar Linear",preview:"Stroke icons",iconifyUrl:"https://icon-sets.iconify.design/solar/",description:"Use Solar Linear icons for clean, consistent stroke-based interface and feature iconography."},{id:"solar-duotone-bold",label:"Solar Duotone Bold",preview:"Two-tone bold",iconifyUrl:"https://icon-sets.iconify.design/solar/",description:"Use Solar Duotone Bold icons for stronger, two-tone visual emphasis in hero, feature, and callout moments."},{id:"solar-broken",label:"Solar Broken",preview:"Broken stroke",iconifyUrl:"https://icon-sets.iconify.design/solar/",description:"Use Solar Broken icons for expressive broken-line icon styling with a more distinctive technical feel."},{id:"lucide",label:"Lucide",preview:"Minimal line",iconifyUrl:"https://icon-sets.iconify.design/lucide/",description:"Use Lucide icons for crisp, lightweight, minimal line iconography across interface controls and supporting UI."},{id:"mingcute-line",label:"MingCute Line",preview:"Rounded line",iconifyUrl:"https://icon-sets.iconify.design/mingcute/",description:"Use Mi